  «text (-950,2600) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿MATLAB Coder Integration Demo with QSPICE\n=========================================\nImportant Note:\n  Ensure the entire working directory path contains NO spaces\n  (e.g., use C:\\Qspice_Demo\\, not C:\\My Projects\\Qspice Demo\\).\n\nMatLab Toolbox:  'MATLAB Coder'\n\nFiles:\n  my_circuit.qsch  - QSPICE schematic file (this file)\n  pi_block.cpp     - QSPICE C++ wrapper for pi_block\n  pi_controller.m  - MATLAB discrete-time PI controller function\n  matlab_codegen.m - MATLAB Coder script for standalone C generation\n\nProject Rebuild Workflow:\n  1. Run matlab_codegen.m in MATLAB to generate the "qspice_bundle"\n     subfolder containing the exported C source/header files.\n  2. Open and run my_circuit.qsch in QSPICE to automatically compile\n     pi_block.cpp and the bundled C files into a single .dll."»
